@startuml kairos-view-create-outreach-program
title View and Create Outreach Program

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open Outreach Program List
WebAdmin -> API: GET /outreach-programs?branchId=...
API -> DB: SELECT programs
DB --> API: List
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {programs}

Admin -> WebAdmin: Click "Create Outreach"
Admin -> WebAdmin: Fill form\nClick "Save"
WebAdmin -> API: POST /outreach-programs {data}
API -> DB: INSERT OutreachProgram
DB --> API: New id
API --> WebAdmin: 201 Created

@enduml
